# ==============================================================================
# FestFlow Environment Variables Example
# ==============================================================================

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. PUBLIC FRONTEND CLIENT VARIABLES (Vite / Browser)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Safe to expose in frontend code. Accessible via import.meta.env.*
# Obtain these from your Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# Optional: Razorpay Public Key for Instant Online Checkout (INR)
# Obtain from Razorpay Dashboard -> Settings -> API Keys (Key Id)
# Starts with rzp_test_ (for test mode) or rzp_live_ (for production)
VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_test_your_razorpay_key_id_here

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. SERVER-SIDE ONLY SECRETS (Supabase Edge Functions / Backend)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WARNING: NEVER prefix these with VITE_ or expose them in client frontend code!
# These must be set securely in the Supabase CLI or Supabase Dashboard:
# Command: supabase secrets set RESEND_API_KEY=re_... RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=...
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_resend_api_key_here
# RESEND_FROM_EMAIL="FestFlow <events@yourdomain.com>"
# RESEND_FROM_NAME="FestFlow Events"
#
# RESEND VERIFIED-DOMAIN REQUIREMENTS:
# 1. Custom Domain Delivery:
#    To send from your custom college/organization domain (e.g. events@yourdomain.com):
#    - Navigate to https://resend.com/domains
#    - Add your domain and configure the provided DNS records (DKIM, SPF, MX) at your DNS provider.
#    - Delivery to arbitrary student emails will fail or bounce if the sender domain is unverified.
# 2. Testing / Sandbox Mode (Without Custom Domain):
#    - If no domain is verified yet, Resend restricts delivery:
#      * Sender MUST be set to "onboarding@resend.dev"
#      * Recipient MUST be the email address registered with your Resend account.
# 3. Security:
#    - Never commit real Resend API keys to Git. Keep them exclusively in Supabase Edge Function secrets:
#      supabase secrets set RESEND_API_KEY=re_... RESEND_FROM_EMAIL="FestFlow <events@yourdomain.com>"
#
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=your_razorpay_secret_key_here
# RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your_razorpay_webhook_secret_here
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your_supabase_service_role_key_here
# ENVIRONMENT=production
